00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:36,000
I'll Do Anything is a comedy, drama, music film directed by James L. Brooks.

3
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Matt Hobbs is a talented but unsuccessful actor.

4
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:06,000
When estranged (and strange) ex-wife Beth dumps their daughter Jeannie on
Matt, father and daughter have a lot of adjusting to do.

5
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:51,000
His budding relationship with attractive production assistant Cathy Breslow is made
complicated, while the precocious child is overly accustomed to getting her own way.

6
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:36,000
Matt eventually faces the choice of family vs
career in a particularly difficult way.

7
