13
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:51,000
I'll Do Anything is a 1994 American comedy-drama
film written and directed by James L.

14
01:20:30,000 --> 01:20:36,000
While a large part of the film is a satire of the film industry,
it also skewers relationships from various angles.

15
01:26:15,000 --> 01:26:21,000
Its primary plot concerns a down-on-his-luck actor who suddenly finds
himself the sole caretaker of his six-year-old daughter.

16
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:06,000
The film starred Nick Nolte and Whittni Wright in her film debut, with supporting roles
filled by Albert Brooks, Julie Kavner, Joely Richardson and Tracey Ullman.

17
01:37:45,000 --> 01:37:51,000
I'll Do Anything was released by Columbia Pictures on February 4, 1994.

18
01:43:30,000 --> 01:43:36,000
The film received mixed to positive reviews from critics but was a box office
bomb as it grossed $10 million against a $40 million budget.

19
01:49:15,000 --> 01:49:21,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
